{"5422950":{"success":true,"data":{"type":"game","name":"No Slackers in My Sect","steam_appid":5422950,"required_age":0,"is_free":false,"detailed_description":"<strong>Ever wanted to experience a vast beast tide straight out of a cultivation novel?<\/strong><br><br>As hordes of beasts approach your gates, the disciples you've raised take their places on the walls. Behind them stand your newly built alchemy workshop, your hard-earned supplies, and everything your sect has grown into since its first few members arrived.<br><br>This time, you are the sect leader. Gather your cultivators and defend the home you've built together.<br><br>No Slackers in My Sect is a sect management game set in a world of cultivation and the pursuit of immortality. It brings together disciple growth, production, and large-scale battles against beast tides. Recruit disciples, build your sect, brew elixirs, and forge equipment. Watch your people grow, and prepare them for the battles ahead.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Start with a handful of disciples. Give them a home.<\/h2>At first, there are few hands and little to spare. Spirit fields need tending, mines need workers, the alchemy workshop awaits its first batch, and someone must keep watch at the gates.<br><br>Some disciples have a gift for alchemy. Others are suited to mining, while a few deserve your special attention. Learn their talents and spiritual roots, find the right place for each of them, and watch your little sect build its own industries—and nurture cultivators you can depend on.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Watch your disciples find their way toward immortality<\/h2>Choose their equipment, prepare their elixirs, and plan their training retreats and breakthroughs. Under your care, the novices who once knew so little will rise through the realms and become pillars of your sect.<br><br>Cultivation takes supplies, and seclusion means time away from work. With limited lifespans, workers, and resources, you must decide who pursues a breakthrough first and who keeps the sect running. Let this generation's efforts pave the way for those who follow.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Every quiet day's work helps you weather the siege<\/h2>Turn gathered spirit herbs into elixirs and mined ore into equipment. Tend your spirit fields, run your markets, and send disciples to develop outposts beyond the walls and bring supplies home.<br><br>The production chains you build, piece by piece, sustain daily cultivation while stockpiling equipment, wall repair materials, and the spirit stones your protective formation needs. When the beast tide comes, those small everyday decisions will carry their weight.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >When the beast tide comes, stand together at the gates<\/h2>As your sect grows, so do the tides that threaten it. Vanguards arrive first, the main horde follows, and fearsome leaders march with the horde. Later sieges pit you against hundreds of beasts, turning your familiar home into the battlefield of a vast clash.<br><br>Defenders fight from the walls as disciples intercept beasts up close, cast spells, and heal their companions. If a wall falls, beasts pour through the breach, and the battle spills from outside the walls into the grounds within.<br><br>Send disciples to intercept the tide before it reaches you. When the fighting turns desperate, redeploy reinforcements, repair the walls, and activate your sect's protective formation. Who holds the breach? Who supports the other line? How long will the remaining supplies last? These decisions rest on your shoulders.<br><br>After the tide, mend the walls, let the wounded recover, and help your disciples return to their familiar work. Life in the sect goes on, with another breakthrough and another great battle waiting ahead.<br><br><strong>Each has a role in times of peace. When the beast tide comes, the whole sect stands together.<\/strong>","about_the_game":"<strong>Ever wanted to experience a vast beast tide straight out of a cultivation novel?<\/strong><br><br>As hordes of beasts approach your gates, the disciples you've raised take their places on the walls. Behind them stand your newly built alchemy workshop, your hard-earned supplies, and everything your sect has grown into since its first few members arrived.<br><br>This time, you are the sect leader. Gather your cultivators and defend the home you've built together.<br><br>No Slackers in My Sect is a sect management game set in a world of cultivation and the pursuit of immortality. It brings together disciple growth, production, and large-scale battles against beast tides. Recruit disciples, build your sect, brew elixirs, and forge equipment. Watch your people grow, and prepare them for the battles ahead.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Start with a handful of disciples. Give them a home.<\/h2>At first, there are few hands and little to spare. Spirit fields need tending, mines need workers, the alchemy workshop awaits its first batch, and someone must keep watch at the gates.<br><br>Some disciples have a gift for alchemy. Others are suited to mining, while a few deserve your special attention. Learn their talents and spiritual roots, find the right place for each of them, and watch your little sect build its own industries—and nurture cultivators you can depend on.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Watch your disciples find their way toward immortality<\/h2>Choose their equipment, prepare their elixirs, and plan their training retreats and breakthroughs. Under your care, the novices who once knew so little will rise through the realms and become pillars of your sect.<br><br>Cultivation takes supplies, and seclusion means time away from work. With limited lifespans, workers, and resources, you must decide who pursues a breakthrough first and who keeps the sect running. Let this generation's efforts pave the way for those who follow.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Every quiet day's work helps you weather the siege<\/h2>Turn gathered spirit herbs into elixirs and mined ore into equipment. Tend your spirit fields, run your markets, and send disciples to develop outposts beyond the walls and bring supplies home.<br><br>The production chains you build, piece by piece, sustain daily cultivation while stockpiling equipment, wall repair materials, and the spirit stones your protective formation needs. When the beast tide comes, those small everyday decisions will carry their weight.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >When the beast tide comes, stand together at the gates<\/h2>As your sect grows, so do the tides that threaten it. Vanguards arrive first, the main horde follows, and fearsome leaders march with the horde. Later sieges pit you against hundreds of beasts, turning your familiar home into the battlefield of a vast clash.<br><br>Defenders fight from the walls as disciples intercept beasts up close, cast spells, and heal their companions. If a wall falls, beasts pour through the breach, and the battle spills from outside the walls into the grounds within.<br><br>Send disciples to intercept the tide before it reaches you. When the fighting turns desperate, redeploy reinforcements, repair the walls, and activate your sect's protective formation. Who holds the breach? Who supports the other line? How long will the remaining supplies last? These decisions rest on your shoulders.<br><br>After the tide, mend the walls, let the wounded recover, and help your disciples return to their familiar work. Life in the sect goes on, with another breakthrough and another great battle waiting ahead.<br><br><strong>Each has a role in times of peace. When the beast tide comes, the whole sect stands together.<\/strong>","short_description":"Ever wanted to face the beast tides of a cultivation novel? Build a sect, raise disciples, brew elixirs and forge their gear. When hordes besiege your walls, lead the disciples you've nurtured into vast battles to defend the home you've built together.","supported_languages":"English<strong>*<\/strong>, French<strong>*<\/strong>, German<strong>*<\/strong>, Spanish - Spain<strong>*<\/strong>, Russian<strong>*<\/strong>, Japanese<strong>*<\/strong>, Polish<strong>*<\/strong>, Simplified Chinese<strong>*<\/strong>, Traditional Chinese<strong>*<\/strong>, Portuguese - Brazil<strong>*<\/strong>, Korean<br><strong>*<\/strong>languages with full audio support","header_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5422950\/d563d5eec06bc2e7650e807b8b4805254687d9bd\/header.jpg?t=1793668043","capsule_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5422950\/aeae82f7578f9a1624e2e226a39a7e5556293171\/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1793668043","capsule_imagev5":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5422950\/aeae82f7578f9a1624e2e226a39a7e5556293171\/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1793668043","website":null,"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br><\/li><li><strong>OS:<\/strong> Windows 10 64-bit<br><\/li><li><strong>Processor:<\/strong> Intel Core i3-8100 \/ AMD Ryzen 3 1200<br><\/li><li><strong>Memory:<\/strong> 8 GB RAM<br><\/li><li><strong>Graphics:<\/strong> Intel UHD Graphics 630 or equivalent, with OpenGL 3.3 support<br><\/li><li><strong>Storage:<\/strong> 2 GB available space<\/li><\/ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br><\/li><li><strong>OS:<\/strong> Windows 10 \/ 11 64-bit<br><\/li><li><strong>Processor:<\/strong> Intel Core i5-10400 \/ AMD Ryzen 5 3600<br><\/li><li><strong>Memory:<\/strong> 8 GB RAM<br><\/li><li><strong>Graphics:<\/strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 1050 (2 GB) \/ AMD Radeon RX 560 (2 GB)<br><\/li><li><strong>Storage:<\/strong> 2 GB available space<\/li><\/ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><\/ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><\/ul>"},"linux_requirements"